are the inputs for Registerdata, which can be {data,mask,vox}.\\nAfter the \
registeration is done the moving2nd data is deformed acording to the output \
of the registrtion of moving.\\n\\nmoving2nd can have the same dimensions of \
moving or one dimension higher (e.g. 3D and 3D or 3D and 4D). \\n\\nOutput is \
{registered moving, deformed moving2nd}.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
