    "FracCorrect[fraction, time] corrects the signal fraction calculated with \
the IVIM model for tissue relaxation and acquisition parameters.\nAfter \
correction the signal fraction can be regarded as volume fraction.\n\
FracCorrect[{fraction1, fraction2}, time] corrects the signal fraction1 and \
fraction2 from a 3 compartement IVIM model. \n\ntime is {{te, tr}, {t2t, \
t21}, {t1t, t11}} or {{te, tr}, {t2t, t21, t22}, {t1t, t11, t12}}\nwhere t2t \
and t1t are \"tissue\" relaxation times and t11 t12, t21 and t22 the \
\"fluid\" relaxation times \n\nThe te and tr as well as the relaxation times \
