that is defined is cached.\\n\\nThe output is in units as defined by the \
detlaTE, e.g. if detlaTE is in ms the output is in ms.\\nThe TR and TE should \
be in the same units as Dela\\n\\nOutput is {dictionary, vals}\"\>", 
             "InformationUsageText",
